message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Plant Intelligence Lab: Applied Data Science for Genomic Prediction, Phenotype Forecasting and Biological Decision Support"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Pereira"
    given-names: "Rodolfo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/plant-intelligence-lab"
abstract: "Python research software demonstrating end-to-end applied data science on public plant genomics and phenotyping data, including high-dimensional genomic prediction, environment-aware validation, phenotype forecasting, uncertainty calibration, external temporal evaluation, failure analysis, reproducible evidence, and evidence-grounded scientific interaction."
keywords:
  - applied data science
  - genomics
  - genomic prediction
  - quantitative genetics
  - plant biotechnology
  - machine learning
  - phenotype forecasting
  - genotype by environment
  - uncertainty quantification
  - external validation
  - reproducible research
  - biological decision support
